131
00:15:55.425 --> 00:15:58.386
It appeared in the November 2025 exam.
[DA] ✔ A: Socialdemokraterne

132
00:15:58.936 --> 00:16:00.236
Question 4.

133
00:16:00.186 --> 00:16:08.186
Which party did Lars Løkke Rasmussen belong to when he was prime minister in 2009 to 11 and 2015 to 19?

134
00:16:08.186 --> 00:16:10.224
Option A: Venstre.

135
00:16:10.224 --> 00:16:13.061
Option B: The Social Democrats.

136
00:16:13.061 --> 00:16:16.236
Option C: The Conservative People's Party.
[DA] Hvilket parti tilhørte Lars Løkke Rasmussen, da han var statsminister i perioderne 2009-11 og 2015-19?  A: Venstre  |  B: Socialdemokratiet  |  C: Det Konservative Folkeparti

137
00:16:22.786 --> 00:16:24.886
The answer is A: Venstre.

138
00:16:24.836 --> 00:16:27.486
It appeared in the May 2023 exam.
[DA] ✔ A: Venstre

139
00:16:28.036 --> 00:16:29.499
Question 5.

140
00:16:29.449 --> 00:16:34.611
