[DA] ✔ C: 2022

167
00:18:14.520 --> 00:18:16.392
Question 9.

168
00:18:16.392 --> 00:18:19.056
Which of the following parties is the oldest?

169
00:18:19.056 --> 00:18:22.200
Option A: The Social Liberal Party.

170
00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:24.336
Option B: SF.

171
00:18:24.336 --> 00:18:27.456
Option C: The Red-Green Alliance.
[DA] Hvilket af følgende partier er ældst?  A: Radikale Venstre  |  B: SF  |  C: Enhedslisten

172
