The answer is A: The Social Liberal Party.

173
00:18:37.131 --> 00:18:41.658
It appeared in the May 2023 and November 2025 exams.
[DA] ✔ A: Radikale Venstre

174
00:18:42.108 --> 00:18:43.980
Question 10.

175
00:18:43.980 --> 00:18:46.644
Which of the following parties is the oldest?

176
00:18:46.644 --> 00:18:49.884
Option A: The Conservative People's Party.

177
00:18:49.884 --> 00:18:53.628
Option B: The Socialist People's Party, SF.

178
00:18:53.628 --> 00:18:56.820
Option C: The Danish People's Party.
[DA] Hvilket af følgende politiske partier er ældst?  A: Det Konservative Folkeparti  |  B: Socialistisk Folkeparti  |  C: Dansk Folkeparti

179
00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:06.683
The answer is A: The Conservative People's Party.

180
00:19:06.633 --> 00:19:10.758
It appeared in the June 2020 and November 2020 exams.
[DA] ✔ A: Det Konservative Folkeparti

181
00:19:11.308 --> 00:19:12.783
Question 11.

182
00:19:12.733 --> 00:19:15.221
Which of the following parties is the newest?

183
00:19:15.221 --> 00:19:18.696
Option A: Alternativet, the Alternative.

184
00:19:18.696 --> 00:19:21.846
Option B: The Socialist People's Party.

185
